@startuml vault-system-diagram
title ObsidianJP Vault — Agent & Skill System

' ─── Shared storage ───
database ".claude/agents/" as AgentsDir
database ".cowork/skills/" as SkillsDir
database ".cowork/skills/references/" as ReferencesDir
database ".cowork/instructions.md" as Instructions
database "Plans/" as PlansDir
database "Scribe/" as ScribeDir
database "docs/" as DocsDir
database "JPLessons/" as Lessons
database "grammar-index/" as GrammarIndex
database "Vocabulary/" as VocabDir
database "Caligraphy/" as CaligraphyDir
database ".cowork/progress/" as ProgressDir
database ".cowork/tmp/" as TmpDir
database "vault root (KanjiList.md, *.ics)" as VaultRoot

' ─── Agents ───
package "Agents" {
  component [reviewer] as Reviewer <<agent>>
  note right of Reviewer
    tools: Read, Bash, Agent
    reads: .cowork/skills/, .claude/agents/,
           .cowork/instructions.md, Plans/, Scribe/
    git: read-only (log/show/diff/status)
    no access: JPLessons/, git write commands
    never writes/edits any file
    never calls scribe directly (planner does)
  end note

  component [planner] as Planner <<agent>>
  note right of Planner
    tools: Read, Write, Edit, Bash, Agent
    reads/writes: Plans/ only
    calls scribe after plan is saved
  end note

  component [skill-implementer] as SkillImplementer <<agent>>
  note right of SkillImplementer
    tools: Read, Write, Edit, Bash, Agent
    reads: Plans/, JPLessons/ (context only),
           grammar-index/, Vocabulary/, .cowork/progress/
    writes: .cowork/skills/, .claude/agents/,
            Plans/ (checkbox updates only, autonomous)
    (confirms before writing grammar-index/, Vocabulary/,
     .cowork/instructions.md — extra caution, rare)
    never modifies lesson files unless explicitly asked
    never pushes to git
    calls documentation automatically after skill/agent file changes
  end note

  component [scribe] as Scribe <<agent>>
  note right of Scribe
    tools: Read, Write, Edit, Bash
    reads: .cowork/ (read-only), .claude/ (read-only)
    writes: Scribe/ only
    no access: JPLessons/
    modes: capture, git-sweep, retrospect, post
  end note

  component [documentation] as Documentation <<agent>>
  note right of Documentation
    tools: Read, Write, Edit, Bash, Agent
    reads: .claude/agents/, .cowork/skills/, .cowork/instructions.md
    writes: docs/ only (vault-system-diagram.puml)
    no access: JPLessons/, Scribe/, Plans/
    does not call scribe itself (generate-diagram skill does)
  end note
}

package 'Deprecated' {
  component [orchestrator] as Orchestrator <<agent>> <<deprecated>>
  note right of Orchestrator
    DEPRECATED — replaced by direct agent routing
    tools: Read, Bash, Agent (no Write/Edit)
    sole permitted write: .cowork/tmp/orchestrator-handoff.md (slug handoff)
  end note

  component [skill-updater] as SkillUpdater <<agent>> <<deprecated>>
  note right of SkillUpdater
    DEPRECATED — replaced by reviewer -> planner -> skill-implementer
    tools: Read, Write, Edit, Bash, Agent
    kept for reference only; not invoked in new workflows
  end note
}

' ─── Agent -> Agent calls (A2A) ───
Orchestrator --> Reviewer : calls
Orchestrator --> Planner : calls
Orchestrator --> SkillImplementer : calls
Reviewer --> Planner : calls
Planner --> SkillImplementer : calls
Planner --> Reviewer : calls
Planner --> Scribe : calls
SkillImplementer --> Documentation : calls
SkillImplementer --> Reviewer : calls
SkillImplementer --> Scribe : calls

' ─── Agent -> Skill (loads) ───
Documentation --> GenerateDiagram : loads

' ─── Agent read/write edges ───
Reviewer ..> SkillsDir : reads
Reviewer ..> AgentsDir : reads
Reviewer ..> Instructions : reads
Reviewer ..> PlansDir : reads
Reviewer ..> ScribeDir : reads

Planner ..> PlansDir : reads
Planner --> PlansDir : writes

SkillImplementer ..> PlansDir : reads
SkillImplementer --> PlansDir : writes (checkbox updates only)
SkillImplementer --> SkillsDir : writes
SkillImplementer --> AgentsDir : writes
SkillImplementer ..> Lessons : reads
SkillImplementer ..> ProgressDir : reads
SkillImplementer ..> GrammarIndex : reads
SkillImplementer --> GrammarIndex : writes
SkillImplementer ..> VocabDir : reads
SkillImplementer --> VocabDir : writes
SkillImplementer --> Instructions : writes (confirm-gated, rare)

Scribe ..> SkillsDir : reads
Scribe ..> AgentsDir : reads
Scribe --> ScribeDir : writes

Documentation ..> AgentsDir : reads
Documentation ..> SkillsDir : reads
Documentation ..> Instructions : reads
Documentation --> DocsDir : writes

Orchestrator ..> PlansDir : reads
Orchestrator --> TmpDir : writes

SkillUpdater ..> SkillsDir : reads
SkillUpdater --> SkillsDir : writes
SkillUpdater ..> Instructions : reads
SkillUpdater ..> Lessons : reads

' ─── Skills (top-level) ───
package "Skills (top-level)" {
  component [fill-templates] as FillTemplates <<skill>>
  note right of FillTemplates
    script: .cowork/skills/fill_extract.py
    (hardcoded remote mount path in skill body —
    inconsistent with vault-root convention used elsewhere)
  end note

  component [templates-update] as TemplatesUpdate <<skill>>
  note right of TemplatesUpdate
    scripts: .cowork/scripts/preprocess-templates.py,
             .cowork/scripts/kanji-links.py
  end note

  component [practice-grammar] as PracticeGrammar <<skill>>
  component [practice-grammar-study-mode] as PracticeGrammarStudyMode <<skill>>
  note right of PracticeGrammarStudyMode
    sub-skill, loaded on demand by practice-grammar
    never writes grammar-state.json
  end note

  component [practice-grammar-srs] as PracticeGrammarSRS <<skill>>
  note right of PracticeGrammarSRS
    sub-skill, loaded once at session end
    scripts: .cowork/scripts/load-control.py,
             .cowork/scripts/ics-export.py
  end note

  component [reading-jlpt] as ReadingJLPT <<skill>>
  component [summarize-grammar] as SummarizeGrammar <<skill>>

  component [manage-holidays] as ManageHolidays <<skill>>
  note right of ManageHolidays
    scripts: .cowork/scripts/load-control.py,
             .cowork/scripts/ics-export.py
  end note

  component [kanji-headers] as KanjiHeaders <<skill>>
  component [kanji-file] as KanjiFile <<skill>>
  component [generate-diagram] as GenerateDiagram <<skill>>
  component [extract-vocabulary] as ExtractVocabulary <<skill>>

  component [git-commit] as GitCommit <<skill>>
  note right of GitCommit
    NOT listed in .cowork/instructions.md "Available skills" registry
    — orphaned/undocumented skill (gap)
    workflow: git add/commit/push (requires user confirmation)
  end note

  component [update-kanji-list] as UpdateKanjiList <<skill>> <<deprecated>>
  note right of UpdateKanjiList
    DEPRECATED — superseded by kanji-headers + kanji-file
    retained for reference only
  end note
}

' ─── Skills (lesson-to-web) ───
package "Skills (lesson-to-web)" {
  component [_conventions] as Conventions <<skill>>
  note right of Conventions
    shared output contract, no trigger phrase —
    loaded unconditionally by every lesson-to-web skill
  end note

  component [_patterns] as Patterns <<skill>>
  note right of Patterns
    input-recognition registry, lazy-loaded only on
    unrecognised source format
  end note

  component [extract-grammar] as ExtractGrammar <<skill>>
  component [preprocess-grammar] as PreprocessGrammar <<skill>>
  note right of PreprocessGrammar
    scripts: .claude/scripts/grammar-process.py,
             .claude/scripts/furigana-convert.py
  end note

  component [review-grammar] as ReviewGrammar <<skill>>
  component [structure-grammar] as StructureGrammar <<skill>>
  component [see-also-grammar] as SeeAlsoGrammar <<skill>>
  note right of SeeAlsoGrammar
    scripts: .claude/scripts/grammar-audit.py,
             .claude/scripts/grammar-process.py
  end note

  component [update-grammar] as UpdateGrammarChain <<skill>>
}

' ─── Skill -> Agent (A2A) ───
GenerateDiagram --> Scribe : calls

' ─── Skill chains to skill ───
PracticeGrammar --> PracticeGrammarStudyMode : chains
PracticeGrammar --> PracticeGrammarSRS : chains
ReadingJLPT --> FillTemplates : chains
KanjiHeaders --> KanjiFile : chains
ExtractGrammar --> PreprocessGrammar : chains
PreprocessGrammar --> ReviewGrammar : chains
ReviewGrammar --> StructureGrammar : chains
StructureGrammar --> SeeAlsoGrammar : chains
UpdateGrammarChain --> PreprocessGrammar : chains (drives full pipeline)

ExtractGrammar ..> Conventions : loads
PreprocessGrammar ..> Conventions : loads
PreprocessGrammar ..> Patterns : loads (lazy)
ReviewGrammar ..> Conventions : loads
StructureGrammar ..> Conventions : loads
SeeAlsoGrammar ..> Conventions : loads
UpdateGrammarChain ..> Conventions : loads

' ─── Skill -> Storage ───
FillTemplates --> Lessons : writes
FillTemplates ..> ReferencesDir : reads

TemplatesUpdate --> Lessons : writes
TemplatesUpdate ..> ReferencesDir : reads

PracticeGrammar ..> Lessons : reads
PracticeGrammar ..> ProgressDir : reads

PracticeGrammarSRS --> ProgressDir : writes
PracticeGrammarSRS --> VaultRoot : writes

ReadingJLPT --> Lessons : writes
note right of ReadingJLPT
  writes session files to JPLessons/Reading/ only
  (explicit exception to general JPLessons/ read-only rule)
end note

SummarizeGrammar ..> Lessons : reads
SummarizeGrammar --> GrammarIndex : writes

ManageHolidays --> ProgressDir : writes
ManageHolidays --> VaultRoot : writes

KanjiHeaders --> Lessons : writes
KanjiHeaders --> CaligraphyDir : writes
KanjiHeaders --> VaultRoot : writes

KanjiFile --> CaligraphyDir : writes

UpdateKanjiList --> CaligraphyDir : writes
UpdateKanjiList --> VaultRoot : writes

ExtractVocabulary ..> Lessons : reads
ExtractVocabulary --> VocabDir : writes

GitCommit --> VaultRoot : writes (git commit/push)

GenerateDiagram ..> AgentsDir : reads
GenerateDiagram ..> SkillsDir : reads
GenerateDiagram ..> Instructions : reads
GenerateDiagram --> DocsDir : writes

ExtractGrammar ..> Lessons : reads
ExtractGrammar --> GrammarIndex : writes
ExtractGrammar --> Lessons : writes
note right of ExtractGrammar
  step 8 exception: inserts one wikilink into the source
  lesson file — the sole lesson-to-web write outside grammar-index/
end note

PreprocessGrammar --> GrammarIndex : writes
ReviewGrammar --> GrammarIndex : writes
StructureGrammar --> GrammarIndex : writes
SeeAlsoGrammar --> GrammarIndex : writes

@enduml
